<title>ITALY: DE Silguy says no plot to exclude anyone from EMU.</title>
<headline>DE Silguy says no plot to exclude anyone from EMU.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU Commissioner Thibault de Silguy said on Thursday there was no plot to exclude any country from joining European economic and monetary union (EMU), whose launch is planned for 1999.</p>
<p>&quot;There is no plot to exclude one country or another from EMU. All countries will be treated in the same way and the admission examination will be based on economic and not geographic criteria,&quot; De Silguy told a news conference.</p>
</text>
